WEBVTT

00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:16,100
Why can gluten be an issue for a cancer patient?

00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:27,100
So gluten, remember, gluten is what is found in wheat.

00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:35,100
It's the protein in wheat, rye, spelt, malt, barley.

00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:40,100
And rye added is actually the protein.

00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:43,100
And you could have sensitivities to it.

00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:46,100
So gluten can be inflammatory.

00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:49,100
So even if you don't have sensitivities,

00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:55,100
I mean, antibodies to gluten or one of its part, you know,

00:00:55,100 --> 00:01:00,100
particles of gluten, which are called peptides of a protein.

00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:06,100
You don't have antibodies against gluten as an entire molecule

00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:08,100
or its peptides.

00:01:08,100 --> 00:01:11,100
It still could be inflammatory.

00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:17,100
So it can cause anything that can cause inflammation in your body

00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:23,100
or inflammation in your gut can hinder your immune system's ability

00:01:23,100 --> 00:01:28,100
to do other things, in this case, or a cancer patient to kill cancer cells.

00:01:28,100 --> 00:01:32,100
Is it a good idea for cancer patients to go gluten free?

00:01:32,100 --> 00:01:34,100
Maybe that would be an extension of this.

00:01:34,100 --> 00:01:37,100
Yeah, that would be a good idea.

00:01:37,100 --> 00:01:38,100
Is it necessary?

00:01:38,100 --> 00:01:41,100
Is gluten ever feeding the cancer?

00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:42,100
Typically no.

00:01:42,100 --> 00:01:47,100
Gluten is not going to be a feeder of a cancer, a specific

00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:50,100
gliadid as a protein.

00:01:50,100 --> 00:01:53,100
It's certainly the peptides of gliadid.

00:01:53,100 --> 00:01:57,100
And it's not going to be a fuel source for cancer.

00:01:57,100 --> 00:02:02,100
But can gluten cause issues with certain cancer patients more than others?

00:02:02,100 --> 00:02:03,100
Yes.

00:02:03,100 --> 00:02:06,100
Especially if you have antibodies against gliander,

00:02:06,100 --> 00:02:09,100
it's peptides you're going to have more inflammation,

00:02:09,100 --> 00:02:13,100
and it's going to cause more of an issue for a person.

00:02:13,100 --> 00:02:18,100
So I will not say that gluten is always going to cause an issue for a cancer patient

00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:20,100
and every cancer patient should go off with gluten.

00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:23,100
But you should at least consider, you know,

00:02:23,100 --> 00:02:26,100
when you're trying to deal with cancer,

00:02:26,100 --> 00:02:29,100
sometimes it's easy to ignore other comorbidities

00:02:29,100 --> 00:02:33,100
that maybe even preceded the diagnosis of cancer.

00:02:33,100 --> 00:02:37,100
A.K.A. would be maybe gut issues and maybe food sensitivities

00:02:37,100 --> 00:02:40,100
that you never really knew that you had,

00:02:40,100 --> 00:02:43,100
nor did you address prior to your diagnosis of cancer.

00:02:43,100 --> 00:02:48,100
And could have actually been a piece of the puzzle

00:02:48,100 --> 00:02:52,100
that broke down your immune system that was a piece of the cause

00:02:52,100 --> 00:02:55,100
of why a person got cancer in the first place.

00:02:55,100 --> 00:02:57,100
They had other ill health.

00:02:57,100 --> 00:03:03,100
In this case, gut inflammation that, you know,

00:03:03,100 --> 00:03:08,100
helped contribute to a worse diagnosis.

00:03:08,100 --> 00:03:13,100
So it's never wise to just ignore other health issues

00:03:13,100 --> 00:03:18,100
just trying to quote unquote treat or kill cancer.

00:03:18,100 --> 00:03:21,100
You have to do a more holistic approach

00:03:21,100 --> 00:03:25,100
and try to get your whole self more healthy.

00:03:25,100 --> 00:03:28,100
That's why with all our cancer patients,

00:03:28,100 --> 00:03:31,100
we also address gut health.

00:03:31,100 --> 00:03:37,100
And that is important because your detoxification pathways,

00:03:37,100 --> 00:03:42,100
your gut health, your overall whole body health,

00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:47,100
is equally important in order for you to listen to proper immune response

00:03:47,100 --> 00:03:49,100
to kill cancer.

00:03:49,100 --> 00:03:52,100
So it's all a piece of that.

00:03:52,100 --> 00:03:56,100
So why can gluten be an issue for a cancer patient?

00:03:56,100 --> 00:03:58,100
All those reasons.

00:03:58,100 --> 00:04:01,100
Anything that can cause inflammation is going to decrease your ability

00:04:01,100 --> 00:04:05,100
to fight an immune elicited immune response to kill cancer.

